orangeark (1.1.5-1) focal; urgency=low

  * OrangeArk: the per-level colours are now on the node ICON itself — the eleven cherry_*.svg fruits each carry their own colour (orange/blue/green/purple/red/teal/...), and the depth→icon order starts at the OrangeArk orange for the root; previously every icon file was the identical orange fruit, so all levels looked the same
  * OrangeArk: the node NAME is no longer recoloured (that was the wrong element); documents saved by intermediate builds have those auto name-colours cleared on load, hand-picked colours are kept
  * OrangeArk: the colour-palette 取色器 is now a real eyedropper — a fullscreen transparent overlay shows a little eyedropper cursor (ct_colour_pick icon), the next left-click anywhere samples that pixel, right-click/Esc cancels
